<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67901" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μῐνυρ-ίζω</span></b> , mostly pres. and
			impf.: aor. 1, <i><span class="en">
			Plu.
			2.56f
		</span></i>: (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μινυρός</span>):— <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>complain in a low tone, whimper,
				whine</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μή μοι . . παρεζόμενος μινύριζε</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					5.889
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">περὶ δὲ δμῳαὶ μινύριζον</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Od.
					4.719
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>sing in a low tone, warble, hum</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>Av.</u>
				1414
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				411a
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μ. μέλη</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Ar.
					<u>V.</u>
					219
				</span></i>
			; opp. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λεληκέναι</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>HA</u>
				618b31
			</span></i>; of the voice of the <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὑπάετος</span>, ib.<i><span class="en">
				619a3
			</span></i>.</div>
